  "text": "This is a synthetic demonstration recording.\n\nGood morning.\n\nThis is the relationship manager calling about Jade Logistics Pte.\n\nLimited.\n\nMay I speak with the finance director, Tan Wei Ming?\n\nSpeaking.\n\nThanks for calling.\n\nOur USD export receipts have grown this quarter, and we would like to talk about FX hedging.\n\nCertainly.\n\nWe can review a forward contract against those USD export receipts.\n\nWhat tenor do you need?\n\nThree to six months.\n\nWe also have a late payment concern.\n\nOur Shanghai partner has delayed two invoices.\n\nUnderstood.\n\nLet me ask your Shanghai partner to confirm the schedule.\n\n大家好，我是上海合作伙伴。下一批货物预计下周三从上海出发。美元货款请在10月31日之前汇出。如果有变化，我们会提前通知。\n\nThank you.\n\nThat helps.\n\nPlease send us the hedging proposal this week.\n\nI will send it by Friday.\n\nThank you for your time.",
